  "triples": [
    {
      "subject": "Katerina Ivanovna",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "‘I love you madly,’ she says, ‘even if you don’t love me, never mind. Be my husband.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Katerina Ivanovna",
      "quote": "Yes, Ivan fell in love with her; he’s in love with her still. I know that.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "ENGAGED_TO",
      "object": "Katerina Ivanovna",
      "quote": "Yes, formally and solemnly betrothed. It was all done on my arrival in Moscow, with great ceremony",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "OWES_MONEY_TO",
      "object": "Katerina Ivanovna",
      "quote": "What, do you suppose I’d shoot myself because I can’t get three thousand to pay back?",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "POSSESSES",
      "object": "three thousand roubles",
      "quote": "So I had that three thousand roubles in my pocket when I went to see Grushenka, and it was that money we spent at Mokroe.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan",
      "relation": "RIVAL_OF",
      "object": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "As for Ivan, I can understand how he must be cursing nature now—with his intellect, too! To see the preference given—to whom, to what?",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Alexey",
      "quote": "“There’s something in it, brother, that no woman could forgive. Do you know what would be the best thing to do?”",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Alexey",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Dmitri",
      "quote": "“Brother, what are you saying?” “Oh, I don’t know.... I don’t know. Perhaps I shan’t kill, and perhaps I shall.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Grushenka",
      "quote": "I’ll be her husband if she deigns to have me, and when lovers come, I’ll go into the next room.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 18,
      "doc_id": "ch018",
      "label_ko": "3편 5장"
    },
